      "right": "275px",
      "text": "בכסף ובשטר ובחזקה: <b><big>מתני'</big></b> <i data-commentator=\"Rabbeinu Efrayim\" data-label=\"א\" data-order=\"1\"></i><span class=\"bavli-ref\" data-bavli-ref=\"(דף עט:)\" data-bavli-daf=\"79b\" data-bavli-index=\"0\"></span>אין <i data-commentator=\"Sefer Mitzvot Gadol\" data-label=\"⚬\"></i><i data-commentator=\"Mishneh Torah, Damages to Property\" data-label=\"⚬\"></i><i data-commentator=\"Tur\" data-label=\"⚬\"></i><i data-commentator=\"Shulchan Arukh, Choshen Mishpat\" data-label=\"⚬\"></i>מגדלין",
